            <title>0.14.91</title>
            <pubDate>Sun, 28 Jun 2026 08:22:40 +0100</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>152</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>0.14.91</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.2</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <sparkle:hardwareRequirements>arm64</sparkle:hardwareRequirements>
            <description><![CDATA[<ul>
<li>The on-device model is no longer re-downloaded when you sign in or out. It&#x27;s now stored once per Mac (it&#x27;s a shared, public model), so switching between guest and your account never costs another ~1.5 GB download. Existing installs move their copy up automatically and reclaim any duplicate.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
